            "review_title": "Review at Madame Son",
            "review_text": "James G\n4 contributions\n0\nI got the personal touch at Madame Son\nNov 2024 • Solo\nI just enjoyed a most wonderful experience staying at Marriott Resort & Spa in Da Nang. 5 star accommodations and service, also with a special personal touch.\nI had created a fantasy menu for my dream 4 course meal and Chef Thinh offered to create it for me in Madame Son Restaurant.\nI think this was the best complete meal I ever had. \nChef Thinh perfectly executed the menu and service was impeccable.\nThanks to Linh, Nicola & the hotel for making this happen. I still can't believe it. Also thanks to Nancy and the breakfast staff for the amazing breakfast each day.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTry the Vietnamese tasting menu with dishes from North, Central & South Vietnam\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 14, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
