            "review_text": "Anthony R\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat at the Marriott Madame Son Restaurant\nMar 2024 • Couples\nGreat service with creative Vietnamese food and the most attentive staff you will find in Da nang .Thank you Vu and staff for making our stay so enjoyable.\nWritten March 15, 2024\nDanang Marriott Resort & Spa\nDear Mr Anthony R,\n\nWarmest Greetings from Madame Son restaurant.\n\nThank you so much for dining with us and leaving a great review.\n\nWe are happy that you had a great experience with us through all aspects; the food, the view, and our service quality.\n\nWe hope to have another chance to welcome you here again soon.\n\nThanks and Best Regards,\n\nMadame Son Team\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
